# no_fs
# TEST: $include builtin was removed (include-decomp-prelude sprint)
# This test verifies that calling [include] raises E002 (undefined variable)
# because $include is no longer defined. The test name is historical but the
# behavior is correct: the removed builtin produces an undefined variable error.
[include "some_file.llt"]
=== error
[E024] missing argument for required parameter 'path' (defined at 5:1-5:26)
  in [include ...] at 5:1-5:26
  in [include ...] at 5:1-5:26

=== warn
cannot unify DirCap with "some_file.llt" at 5:10-5:25
